      "heading": "Seat Math Behind the Big Exams",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 2,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "summary",
            "heading": "Key ideas from this article",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A filter is different from a door."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Career options after 12th are best chosen by lane, not by stream label."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:6",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Not From a Course List",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The most useful first question is not \"which course\"."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Do not choose the most famous course by default."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Count the cost of one more attempt: a year of income, fees, and stress."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "situation",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 6
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:9",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Three Proofs: the High-Income Skill Portfolio",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Whichever lane you choose, a high-income skill portfolio is what raises your income ceiling and brings earlier financial freedom."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The one deep skill that a lane is really paying for: coding, analysis, design, clinical practice, writing, sales, or a trade."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "What raises your value beside it: data with commerce, communication with science, AI use with design, Excel with any office job."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "skills",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 9
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "summary",
      "title": "Seat Math Behind the Big Exams"
    },
